+# Criterion 6's sharing feature costs nothing when off.
+# Release rexx-run without features from git archive trees of 811610f63 (base),
+# 0ac73b804 (head), and base with only head's frame.rs, body.rs, island.rs and
+# scheduler.rs's Posted assertion (aonly: A1-A5, no sharing code); each built
+# at one path in its own target dir by text-hash.sh, then
+# objcopy -O binary --only-section=.text; sha256sum; size.
+# base built twice (base2) as the determinism control.
